{
  "about": "Retired names on the SDK side of the repo: each scan's files may not name any of them, not even to assert their absence. sdk/scripts/scan_retired_tokens.py reads this file (run by sdk/tests/test_retired_token_scan.py); it is the one file every scan skips. `matches` are strings a scan must hit and `spares` its live neighbours it must not.",
  "file_sets": {
    "sources": {
      "about": "The renderers and built-ins, the SDK's runtime packages, shared docs and runtime, scripts and sources: tracked or new files with a source suffix.",
